   "textLength": 330,
   "text": "The React docs at react.dev provide documentation for the latest version of React.\nWe aim to keep the docs updated within major versions, and do not publish versions for each minor or patch version. When a new major is released, we archive the docs for the previous version as x.react.dev. See our versioning policy for more info.",
